<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WESTERN AUSTRALIA 293 FOR SIX DECLARED V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WESTERN AUSTRALIA 293 FOR SIX DECLARED V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australia scored</p>
<p>293 for six declared in their first innings on the first day of</p>
<p>their three-day tour match against West Indies at the WACA on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>Score: Western Australia 293 for six declared (Adam</p>
<p>Gilchrist 108 not out, Mark Lavender 51) v West Indies.</p>
